{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038830/extras/3d5b1ab416577aa35965c14b6b40d422.poster.avif?t=1758320656\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038830/extras/3d5b1ab416577aa35965c14b6b40d422.webm?t=1758320656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038830/extras/3d5b1ab416577aa35965c14b6b40d422.mp4?t=1758320656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Auto Jurassic Knights is a turn-based auto battler where you draft a team of knights and dinosaurs armed with guns. Position your units, stack synergies, and watch battles unfold automatically. Each round challenges you to adapt and evolve your strategy as you unlock new tiers of units and build toward an unstoppable force. It's fast, strategic, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The demo is without multiplayer functionality, the main game will have multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038830/extras/796abbc8ad8d50b254da683f4afdead6.poster.avif?t=1758320656\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038830/extras/796abbc8ad8d50b254da683f4afdead6.webm?t=1758320656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038830/extras/796abbc8ad8d50b254da683f4afdead6.mp4?t=1758320656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn